[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 492.23, "timestamp": "00:08:12", "text": "第二。一秒钟。一秒钟。看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 499.35, "timestamp": "00:08:19", "text": "好的。我们试试看。我们试试看。我们试试看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 500.95, "timestamp": "00:08:20", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 504.469, "timestamp": "00:08:24", "text": "呃，税务员是什么？我想我还是会接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 507.27, "timestamp": "00:08:27", "text": "收费，对吧？我在这场游戏中得了12分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 510.71, "timestamp": "00:08:30", "text": "哇。好的。那么，这个美元符号是什么意思呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 512.31, "timestamp": "00:08:32", "text": "手？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 514.389, "timestamp": "00:08:34", "text": "如何推动？你拿着这张牌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 515.99, "timestamp": "00:08:35", "text": "从那里开始，你就可以推着它到处走。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 517.829, "timestamp": "00:08:37", "text": "抓住它，然后像这样移动它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 520.07, "timestamp": "00:08:40", "text": "如何握住它并摆脱它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 522.87, "timestamp": "00:08:42", "text": "孩子。单击鼠标左键。单击鼠标左键。哦，左边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 526.43, "timestamp": "00:08:46", "text": "点击。是的。嘿，给你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 530.15, "timestamp": "00:08:50", "text": "好的。好的，过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 531.75, "timestamp": "00:08:51", "text": "呃，你应该查看每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 534.71, "timestamp": "00:08:54", "text": "四处看看，看看哪里。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 535.79, "timestamp": "00:08:55", "text": "当你看到这样的事情时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 538.23, "timestamp": "00:08:58", "text": "已标记，直接拿起来就行了。他妈的。库兹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 539.91, "timestamp": "00:08:59", "text": "有些效果就像是奇怪的效果，比如"}]